WEBVTT

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:05.347
Just to finish, they asked me to play that guitar.

00:16:05.347 --> 00:16:07.607
I know this song,

00:16:07.607 --> 00:16:12.827
and it's really a tribute to the genius

00:16:12.827 --> 00:16:14.860
of David Bowie himself,

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:16.773
but it's also, I think,

00:16:16.773 --> 00:16:19.211
a reflection of the fact that we are not machines

00:16:19.211 --> 00:16:20.544
exploring the universe,

00:16:20.544 --> 00:16:21.657
we are people,

00:16:21.657 --> 00:16:23.821
and we're taking

00:16:23.821 --> 00:16:25.997
that ability to adapt

00:16:25.997 --> 00:16:27.527
and that ability to understand

00:16:27.527 --> 00:16:29.503
and the ability to take

00:16:29.503 --> 00:16:33.862
our own self-perception into a new place.